.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the timing side power unit rigid support (1a) in its seating\nand tighten the bolts (1b) to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043872.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the timing side power unit rigid support (1a) in its seating\nand tighten the bolts (1b) to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043872.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the timing side rigid engine support\n(1b) complete with engine lifting bracket (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052402.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428855\">1008B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[2,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428855\">1008B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[4,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428855\">1008B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the timing side rigid engine support (1a), complete with\nengine lifting bracket (1b), in position and secure it tightening\nthe bolts (1c) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ENGINE MOUNT TIMING SIDE</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 5.7 ÷ 6.3</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052403.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<p>Tighten the bolts fixing the air conditioning\npipe mounting brackets to the timing side rigid engine support.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428855\">1008B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]